    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n47978" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">testĭmōnĭālis</span></b> ,
			e, adj.
		testimonium, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>of</i>, <i>belonging to</i>, or <i>serving for evidence</i>, <i>testimonial</i> (late Lat.). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b>
			<i>Adj.</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">comparatio,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Tert. adv. Psych. 16 <i>fin.</i></span></i>
			—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>II.</b>
			<i>Subst.</i>: <b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">te-stĭmōnĭāles</span></b> ,
				ĭum, f. (sc. litterae), <i>testimonials</i>, Cod. Th. 7, 20, 12; 7, 21, 4;
					<i><span class="en">Veg. Mil. 3, 2</span></i>.</div>
